ronment.\n37-\tEnvContext map[string]string\n38-\n39-\t// OutputSection is the body section heading for the LLM's output\n40-\t// (e.g. \"## Analysis\", \"## Review\").\n=== ReplaceSection in claude step ===\n205:\tmd.ReplaceSection(agentlib.Section{\n=== ParseMarkdown ===\n/home/node/go/pkg/mod/github.com/bborbe/agent@v0.89.0/agent_markdown.go:48:func ParseMarkdown(_ context.Context, content string) (*Markdown, error) {\n=== AgentResultInfo ===\n/home/node/go/pkg/mod/github.com/bborbe/agent@v0.89.0/agent_status.go:33:type AgentResultInfo struct {\n/home/node/go/pkg/mod/github.com/bborbe/agent@v0.89.0/agent_status.go-34-\tStatus  AgentStatus\n/home/node/go/pkg/mod/github.com/bborbe/agent@v0.89.0/agent_status.go-35-\tOutput  string // body content (typically heading + fenced JSON)\n/home/node/go/pkg/mod/github.com/bborbe/agent@v0.89.0/agent_status.go-36-\tMessage string // human-readable status; used by failure/needs_input paths\n/home/node/go/pkg/mod/github.com/bborbe/agent@v0.89.0/agent_status.go-37-\t// NextPhase is the task phase the agent requests the controller to write\n/home/node/go/pkg/mod/github.com/bborbe/agent@v0.89.0/agent_status.go-38-\t// when Status == AgentStatusDone. Ignored on Failed/NeedsInput (failure\n/home/node/go/pkg/mod/github.com/bborbe/agent@v0.89.0/agent_status.go-39-\t// paths always escalate to human_review). Empty means \"stay in current\n/home/node/go/pkg/mod/github.com/bborbe/agent@v0.89.0/agent_status.go-40-\t// phase\" — an in-place save between steps of a multi-step phase; the\n/home/node/go/pkg/mod/github.com/bborbe/agent@v0.89.0/agent_status.go-41-\t// task keeps status: in_progress and its phase untouched. Terminating a\n/home/node/go/pkg/mod/github.com/bborbe/agent@v0.89.0/agent_status.go-42-\t// task requires an explicit NextPhase: \"done\". Valid values are vault-cli\n/home/node/go/pkg/mod/github.com/bborbe/agent@v0.89.0/agent_status.go-43-\t// TaskPhase enum strings: planning, execution, ai_review, human_review,\n/home/node/